<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_ui",
    "Message of the Day opens the current server MOTD from the Help menu and displays it in the Status tab."
  )}
</p>

<.help_h4 icon={:icon_folder}>{dgettext("help_ui", "Opening")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext("help_ui", "Choose")}
  <strong>{dgettext("help_ui", "Help > Message of the Day")}</strong>
  {dgettext(
    "help_ui",
    "to re-view the same MOTD that is shown automatically when you connect."
  )}
</p>

<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_ui",
    "The same item is also in the Start menu, under Help > Message of the Day."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_notepad}>{dgettext("help_ui", "What it is for")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_ui",
    "The MOTD is a short note from the people who run the server. It often holds the house rules, news, or planned maintenance. Everyone on the server sees the same text."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_tab_status}>{dgettext("help_ui", "Where it appears")}</.help_h4>
<ol>
  <li>{dgettext("help_ui", "Choose Help > Message of the Day, or type the command.")}</li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_ui",
      "The text is added to the Status tab. The window you are reading stays open."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_ui",
      "If you are not on the Status tab, it is marked as unread. Open the Status tab to read the message."
    )}
  </li>
</ol>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_terminal}>{dgettext("help_ui", "Command Equivalent")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext("help_ui", "The menu item runs")} <code>{dgettext("help_ui", "/motd")}</code>
  {dgettext("help_ui", "and uses the same Status-tab output.")}
</p>

<pre>/motd</pre>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_document_alert}>{dgettext("help_ui", "Rules and limits")}</.help_h4>
<ul>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_ui",
      "If no MOTD is set, you see the message %{text} instead.",
      text: "No MOTD has been set."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_ui",
      "Nothing is shown when you connect while no MOTD is set."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_ui",
      "When an administrator changes or clears the MOTD, every connected user gets a short notice in the Status tab. Run the command again to read the new text."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_ui",
      "The menu item is greyed out until you are connected to the chat."
    )}
  </li>
</ul>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_rules}>{dgettext("help_ui", "Permissions")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_ui",
    "Every connected user can view the MOTD. Server administrators can set or clear it from the Admin Console MOTD tab."
  )}
</p>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_ui",
    "Administrators can also type %{set} followed by the new text, or %{clear} to remove it. Other users who try these commands get a permission error.",
    set: "/setmotd",
    clear: "/clearmotd"
  )}
</p>

<.help_h4 icon={:icon_link}>{dgettext("help_ui", "See Also")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  <.help_link topic="cmd-motd">{dgettext("help_ui", "/motd")}</.help_link>
  · <.help_link topic="cmd-setmotd">{dgettext("help_ui", "/setmotd")}</.help_link>
  · <.help_link topic="cmd-clearmotd">{dgettext("help_ui", "/clearmotd")}</.help_link>
  · <.help_link topic="feature-admin-console">{dgettext("help_ui", "Admin Console")}</.help_link>
  ·
  <.help_link topic="feature-special-messages">
    {dgettext("help_ui", "Special Messages")}
  </.help_link>
</p>
